  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "At a crowded Tokyo disco party celebrating his return, Muranishi marvels at the energy of modern Japan with Kuroki and sincerely thanks Kawada for protecting their company while he was away.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "すごい熱気だ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "ええ、これが今の日本です。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "大学は？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "こないだ正式に退学しました。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "そうか。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "あなたのことが忘れられなかった。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "盛り上がってるとこごめんね。取材が入ってるから。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "すぐ戻ってきます。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "いない間持ちこたえてくれて、ありがとうございます。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "みんなが頑張ってくれました。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "川田さん、あん時はすいませんでした。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "やめてくださいよ。これからもいい作品作ってください。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "すごい熱気だ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What incredible energy in here.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "ええ、これが今の日本です。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yes, this is Japan right now.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "大学は？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'How is university going?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "こないだ正式に退学しました。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I officially withdrew from university the other day.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "そうか。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I see.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "あなたのことが忘れられなかった。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I could never get you out of my mind.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "盛り上がってるとこごめんね。取材が入ってるから。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Sorry to interrupt the moment, she has a press interview scheduled.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "すぐ戻ってきます。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I will be right back.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "いない間持ちこたえてくれて、ありがとうございます。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Thank you for holding everything together while I was gone.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "みんなが頑張ってくれました。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Everyone worked as hard as they could.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "川田さん、あん時はすいませんでした。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Mr. Kawada, I am truly sorry about what happened back then.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "やめてくださいよ。これからもいい作品作ってください。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Stop apologizing. Just keep making great films with us from here on.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
